    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, there was a rumor that spread through the stone village that a stone that climbed to the top of the world tree would be able to fly high into the sky and become a star~? A story of a little stone's challenge to climb to the top of the world tree!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please help the stone, which can only move left and right and jump, climb to the top of the world tree with your divine control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of a total of 1 stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a brain game where it's important to use your left and right hands simultaneously!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the fastest to reach and leave a record</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851100/extras/0d935631b9e591b5b534f84c8b3f4495.avif?t=1753860889\" width=800 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are many obstacles and traps lurking around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid them, reach the top, and turn the stones into stars!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful about your jump direction!\u00a0 (Your jump direction is above your head. You need to make precise movements to decide the direction you want to jump.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping is possible up to 4 times, but the power decreases with each jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you accidentally drop it, it may end up somewhere you don't expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends to master this test of resolve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of nail-biting suspense await</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851100/extras/1128af669200018a7ccaa0e8952ec706.avif?t=1753860889\" width=800 height=469 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>sound and background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to the mysterious world of vertical trees</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The calm forest atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound of a calm atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
